       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is five times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. A dose that high risks serotonin syndrome, seizures, QT prolongation, and severe GI and CNS effects. It may be a typo for 100 mg.\n\nPlease confirm the dose you want. Typical adult dosing is:\n- **Depression, OCD, or anxiety:** start at 25\u201350 mg once daily, then titrate to 50\u2013200 mg once daily.\n- **Maximum:** 200 mg/day.\n\nIf you do want 100 mg (or another dose) by mouth once daily, tell me and I'll enter it right away. If 1000 mg is intentional, for example because of a unit or formulation issue, please tell me the clinical context. I would still advise verifying it with pharmacy before it's ordered."
